$ oikade devices
Error: oikade has no devices command
Hint: oikade list devices lists them, and oikade forget DEVICE forgets one
exit 2

$ oikade devices --json
Error: oikade has no devices command
Hint: oikade list devices lists them, and oikade forget DEVICE forgets one
exit 2

$ oikade devices --wide
Error: oikade has no devices command
Hint: oikade list devices lists them, and oikade forget DEVICE forgets one
exit 2

$ oikade devices --all
Error: oikade has no devices command
Hint: oikade list devices lists them, and oikade forget DEVICE forgets one
exit 2

$ oikade secret list
Error: oikade has no secret command
Hint: your values, passwords included, go in .env beside go.mod: your code reads each with oikade.Var, and oikade deploy sends them
exit 2

$ oikade client list
Error: oikade has no client command
Hint: oikade list clients lists them, and oikade remove client/NAME removes one
exit 2

$ oikade logs
Error: oikade has no logs command
Hint: oikade history shows what your home did, and oikade tail follows it
exit 2

$ oikade events
Error: oikade has no events command
Hint: oikade history shows what your home did, and oikade tail follows it
exit 2

$ oikade ls
Error: oikade has no ls command
Hint: oikade list KIND lists devices, rules, plugins, clients or contexts
exit 2

$ oikade get
Error: oikade has no get command
Hint: oikade status REF shows what something is doing now, and oikade list KIND what's on record
exit 2

$ oikade show
Error: oikade has no show command
Hint: oikade status REF shows what something is doing now, and oikade list KIND what's on record
